      "title": "Police investigate gang links as woman, 19, dies after drive-by shooting at Logan pub south of Brisbane",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/29/woman-19-dies-after-masked-gunmen-opened-fire-outside-brisbane-pub-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Vana-Reese Schuster-Togiatau was injured during the shooting outside Fitzy’s Loganholme pub on Saturday</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Potential gang involvement in the fatal drive-by shooting of a 19-year-old woman is being investigated by Queensland police.</p><p>Vana-Reese Schuster-Togiatau, from Jimboomba, was hit in the head and neck when masked gunmen opened fire into a crowd outside Fitzy’s Loganholme, a pub in Logan, south of Brisbane, on Saturday night.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/29/woman-19-dies-after-masked-gunmen-opened-fire-outside-brisbane-pub-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
